<div class="MainBox ARIARoleMain">
<h1>API identities and tokens</h1>
<p>API identities are machine callers, with no portal password or agent session. Each identity uses an existing customer account only as its authorization subject: SupportAssignments and object entitlements still apply.</p>
[% IF Data.Message %]<div class="MessageBox Notice" role="status"><p>[% Data.Message | html %]</p></div>[% END %]
[% IF Data.NewToken %]<label for="NewToken">New bearer token — copy now</label><textarea id="NewToken" rows="2" readonly autocomplete="off" class="W75pc">[% Data.NewToken | html %]</textarea>[% END %]
<p><a href="[% Env('Baselink') %]Action=AgentTESSERAAPIIdentity">Create API identity</a></p>
<ul>[% FOREACH Identity IN Data.Identities %]<li><a href="[% Env('Baselink') %]Action=AgentTESSERAAPIIdentity;ID=[% Identity.ID | uri %]">[% Identity.Name | html %]</a> — [% Identity.CustomerUserID | html %] [% IF Identity.Enabled %](enabled)[% ELSE %](disabled)[% END %]</li>[% END %]</ul>
<form action="[% Env('CGIHandle') | html %]" method="post" class="Validate PreventMultipleSubmits">
<input type="hidden" name="Action" value="AgentTESSERAAPIIdentity"/><input type="hidden" name="Subaction" value="Save"/>
<input type="hidden" name="ID" value="[% Data.ID | html %]"/><input type="hidden" name="ChallengeToken" value="[% Env('ChallengeToken') | html %]"/>
<fieldset class="TableLike"><legend>Identity, capabilities and data scope</legend>
<label for="Name">API identity name</label><div class="Field"><input id="Name" name="Name" value="[% Data.Name | html %]" maxlength="100" required class="W50pc"/></div><div class="Clear"></div>
<label for="CustomerUserID">Permission subject</label><div class="Field"><input id="CustomerUserID" name="CustomerUserID" value="[% Data.CustomerUserID | html %]" required [% IF Data.ID %]readonly[% END %] class="W50pc"/><p>Existing valid customer login. Immutable after creation. Company membership alone grants no additional scope.</p></div><div class="Clear"></div>
[% FOREACH Grant IN Data.Grants %]<div class="Field"><label><input type="checkbox" name="Grant_[% Grant.Name | html %]" value="1" [% IF Grant.Selected %]checked[% END %]/> [% Grant.Name | html %]</label></div><div class="Clear"></div>[% END %]
[% FOREACH Input IN Data.Inputs %]<label for="[% Input.Name | html %]">[% Input.Name | html %]</label><div class="Field"><input id="[% Input.Name | html %]" name="[% Input.Name | html %]" value="[% Input.Value | html %]" maxlength="2200" class="W50pc"/></div><div class="Clear"></div>[% END %]
<div class="Field"><p>TicketQueueIDs and MELTObjectIDs are comma-separated reporting scope IDs (maximum 200). Scope does not bypass per-object permission checks. Ingestion needs a unique SourceName, existing TargetMELTObjectID and valid agent ActorID for evidence attribution. Risk reporting uses the subject's governed Risk Register.</p><label><input type="checkbox" name="Enabled" value="1" [% IF Data.Enabled %]checked[% END %]/> Enable this API identity</label></div><div class="Clear"></div>
</fieldset><div class="Field"><button type="submit">Save identity</button></div><div class="Clear"></div></form>
[% IF Data.ID %]
<h2>Issue token</h2><p>Tokens inherit this identity's capabilities. For rotation, issue a replacement, update the consumer, then revoke the previous token.</p>
<form action="[% Env('CGIHandle') | html %]" method="post" class="Validate PreventMultipleSubmits">
<input type="hidden" name="Action" value="AgentTESSERAAPIIdentity"/><input type="hidden" name="Subaction" value="Issue"/><input type="hidden" name="ID" value="[% Data.ID | html %]"/><input type="hidden" name="ChallengeToken" value="[% Env('ChallengeToken') | html %]"/>
<label for="TokenName">Token name</label> <input id="TokenName" name="TokenName" maxlength="100" required/>
<label for="Days">Lifetime in days</label> <input id="Days" name="Days" type="number" min="1" max="365" value="30" required/>
<button type="submit">Issue token</button></form>
<h2>Tokens</h2><table class="DataTable"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Name / prefix</th><th scope="col">Expiry</th><th scope="col">Last used</th><th scope="col">Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>
[% FOREACH Token IN Data.Tokens %]<tr><td>[% Token.Name | html %] / [% Token.Prefix | html %]</td><td>[% Token.ExpiresTime | html %]</td><td>[% Token.LastUsedTime | html %]</td><td>[% IF Token.RevokeTime %]Revoked[% ELSE %]
<form action="[% Env('CGIHandle') | html %]" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="Action" value="AgentTESSERAAPIIdentity"/><input type="hidden" name="Subaction" value="Revoke"/><input type="hidden" name="ID" value="[% Data.ID | html %]"/><input type="hidden" name="KeyID" value="[% Token.KeyID | html %]"/><input type="hidden" name="ChallengeToken" value="[% Env('ChallengeToken') | html %]"/><button type="submit">Revoke</button></form>[% END %]</td></tr>[% END %]
</tbody></table>[% END %]
</div>
